          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Résumé: Observation de la chute d'une boule lumineuse.",
          "text_sha256": "7ffac2dcfd21621f7550fe1ea9c410f154c2e4ca6e99839fec92252435ce11ef"
        },
        {
